# Project context

This repo is a personal portfolio built with:
- Next.js App Router (see `src/app/`)
- React 19 + TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS v4 + `tw-animate-css`
- shadcn/ui + Radix UI (see `components.json`, `src/components/ui/`)

## Commands

- Dev: `npm run dev`
- Lint: `npm run lint`
- Build: `npm run build`
- Prod: `npm run start`

## Codebase map

- Pages/layout: `src/app/layout.tsx`, `src/app/page.tsx`, `src/app/globals.css`
- Components: `src/components/**`
- UI primitives (shadcn): `src/components/ui/**`
- Utils: `src/lib/utils.ts` (aliases via `@/*` -> `src/*`)

## House rules

- Prefer simple, readable components; keep animations purposeful (Framer Motion exists).
- Avoid introducing new UI libraries unless necessary; reuse shadcn/Radix primitives.
- Keep changes consistent with existing style/structure in `src/components/sections/*`.
